# Buildifier

When a change touches `BUILD`, `BUILD.bazel`, `*.bzl`, `MODULE.bazel`, or `*.bazelrc`, run:

```sh
bazel run //bazel/buildifier:test
```

That is the `bazel:run-buildifier-test` CI job. If it fails:

```sh
bazel run //bazel/buildifier
bazel run //bazel/buildifier:test
```

Do not commit until the test passes.
